pardon himself, whether he will issue a blanket,&nbsp;
preemptive pardons for his children or son in law&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.960
or Rudy Giuliani at this moment of recording.&nbsp;
And this may change within an hour or within a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:27.680
couple of hours. We don't have that information.&nbsp;
We know Trump is expecting to pardon about 100&nbsp;&nbsp;

