people today. However, we have in the background&nbsp;
an insane story alleging that Rudy Giuliani,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:39.280
Donald Trump's lawyer, I don't know if he's still&nbsp;
technically his lawyer. It's never been clear.&nbsp;&nbsp;

