million dollars. Now, the background on this&nbsp;
is that for some time, we've heard rumblings&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.960 --> 00:01:02.000
of those who were collecting consulting fees,&nbsp;
I guess you would call them in order to lobby&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:07.840
for a pardon from Donald Trump. And now&nbsp;
specifically, Rudy's name and the cash figure of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:14.800
two million dollars is being associated with this.
We know that there have been folks, for example,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:22.800
who have said, listen, if you give me 50 grand,&nbsp;
I'll try to get you a pardon. And if I succeed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

