interesting. As reported by The New York Times,&nbsp;
Mr. Kiriakou, who opted to go with the 50 down 50,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:15.760
if we get it. A payment plan, was also offered&nbsp;
to pay two million dollars to Rudy Giuliani&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.320 --> 00:02:24.080
for what was claimed to be an offer to secure a&nbsp;
pardon. So sort of like, you know, you go to get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:29.760
a car and you can trade in a car or not, and you&nbsp;
can lease or you can finance. And if you lease,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:35.840
you could do 24, 36 months. And maybe you want&nbsp;
10000 miles a year or 12 or 15. There were pardon&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.840 --> 00:02:41.920
plans available. You could choose to do 50 down&nbsp;
50 if we get one. That's one possibility. Or you&nbsp;&nbsp;

